        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-11T19:51:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"defeateddust\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/defeateddust/48/2245_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> defeateddust:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not really my dream alternate universe, but one of my friends brings it up anytime he can so I thought I'd share. In the universe where Legacy dies at the hands of another villain baron blade becaumes distraught. His lifes goal was taken away from him, and in the next few years he decides to take revenge on the villain who took vengence away from him. In that fight he realizes that fighting supervillains is more rewarding and intillectually taxing than heros. This new passion drives him and we see the birth of Baron Blade the Hero.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Baron Blade the Anti-Hero would be awesome.</p>",
