        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-11T21:32:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wayland Smith was my first choice, but I didn't want to go too far down into a Fables comic spiral.I know what you mean about Ariel. &nbsp;I used to have a cat named Nemo and everyone thought it was from the Pixar film as opposed to Little Nemo in Slumberland (his actual namesake).&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have a rabbit called Neo and I have to tell everyone it's nothing to do with The Matrix. It was because when I first got him we couldn't think of a name so he was \"the new bunny\" for a while. Neo=new.</p>",
