        "cooked": "<p>Sentinels Movie-verse:</p><p>Buddy-cop/romantic comedy starring Expatriette and Setback</p><p>Modern war movie starring Bunker and FrightTrain (prequel)</p><p>Mystery/suspense thriller starring NightMist, Wraith, and Parse</p><p>Monster movie starring Chrono-Ranger, Haka, and Naturalist</p><p>Fish-out-of-water movie starring Tempest and Omnitron-X</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The list goes on.</p><p>Also, Tachyon gets her own movie.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
